{
  "en": {
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_TANK_EXPANSION_NAME": "Celestial Tanks",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_TANK_EXPANSION_DESCRIPTION": "Adds content from the mod 'Celestial War Tank' to the game.",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_CANNON_NAME": "Doctor's Cannon",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_CANNON_DESCRIPTION": "Fire the main gun for <style=cIsDamage>2100% damage</style> with <style=cIsDamage>unfaltering critical chance</style>. Critical chance increases damage of the cannon.",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_HOWITZER_CANNON_NAME": "Fatman's Cannon",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_HOWITZER_CANNON_DESCRIPTION": "Charge, and fire the Howitzer for <style=cIsDamage>9100% damage</style>. <style=cIsUtility>Stuns and slows enemies</style>. Has an <color=#d40000>extra excessive knockback</color>, and is risky to fire in-air.",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_CROMWELL_CANNON_NAME": "Boxer's Cannon",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_CROMWELL_CANNON_DESCRIPTION": "Fire the gun for <style=cIsDamage>2975% damage</style>.  <style=cIsDamage>Damage decreases as it travels</style>;  <style=cIsDamage>Proc items instead increase damage</style>.",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_FRENCHGUN_NAME": "French Fries",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_FRENCHGUN_DESCRIPTION": "Now shoots <style=cIsDamage>5x550 damage</style>, with proc of 10.",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_MINIGUN_NAME": "Laser Minigun",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_MINIGUN_DESCRIPTION": "Fire the minigun for <style=cIsDamage>50% damage</style>. Near overheat deals <style=cIsDamage>x2 base damage</style>.  Complete overheat <color=#fc8080>penalizes cooldown</color>. <style=cIsUtility>Attack speed only affects cooldown</style>; <color=#80fc80>Backup Magazines</color> increases time to overheat.",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_T62_CANNON_NAME": "Billy's Cannon",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_T62_CANNON_DESCRIPTION": "Fire the laser gun for <style=cIsDamage>3750% damage</style>. Hitting weak points deals <style=cIsDamage>extra damage</style>.",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_MAUS_NAME": "Fractured Cannon",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_MAUS_DESCRIPTION": "Fire the gun for <style=cIsDamage>8100% damage</style>.  Hitting a enemy deals <color=#E85E31>fire</color>, <color=#AA2B2A>bleed</color>, and <color=#D0E375>weakness</color>.  Possesses the <style=cIsUtility>fastest projectile</style>, allowing for ease of use.",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_AA_NAME": "G/A Cannon",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_AA_DESCRIPTION": "Fire the gun for <style=cIsDamage>405% damage</style>. Projectile detonates <style=cIsDamage>5.5m</style> near <style=cIsUtility>any</style> targets for an extra <style=cIsDamage>2.5x</style> base damage.  While firing, <color=#fc8080>speed is penalized</color>.",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_CANNON_MKII_NAME": "RAIN",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_CANNON_MKII_DESCRIPTION": "Fire the gun for <style=cIsDamage>7x2200% damage</style> in a <style=cIsUtility>great arc</style>.  Damage increases the further it travels, up to <style=cIsDamage>12x5500% damage</style>.\n\nCooldown: 30s\nBlast Radius: 13m/bullet",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_OBLITERATOR_CANNON_NAME": "Oppenheimer’s Unreleased Experimental",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SECONDARY_SCEPTER_OBLITERATOR_CANNON_DESCRIPTION": "Annihilate <color=#d40000>ALL</color> in a 35m for <style=cIsDamage>24000% damage</style>.",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_NAME": "Celestial War Tank",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_DESCRIPTION": "This silly powerhouse can be customized and tuned to various strengths, while being capable of using its many, many weapons to deal with all sorts of foes.\n\n<style=cSub>< ! > Customize your loadout to bring your style of play! Adjust base and unique stats to suit around the tank’s awful regeneration and vertical mobility.\n\n< ! > Be careful of your limited fuel, which affects jump, utilities, and other miscellaneous. Mobility items can aid your fuel’s recharge and limit.\n\n< ! > Tank can climb and ramp off odd terrain with ease. Using utilities can launch you further into the air, allowing you to perform tricks beyond the tank’s odds.\n\n< ! > Tank crashes when landing upside down. However, landing flips grants you speed, fuel, recharges, and negates fall damage!\n\n< ! > Press 'T' to honk.  Configurable in mod settings.\n\n</style>",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_SUBTITLE": "Foreign Entity",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_LORE": "We do not know where this thing originates from. We have only found them in the backpacks of the scavengers.\nThis discovery was found by one man, who kept looping around teleporter after teleporter, fighting scavengers day and night. When one day, while he was scrounging through the big 'ol backpack, he found a tank!\n\n\"This thing quickly gained sentience,\" he said. \"It was vicious! It tried to run me over! Thank goodness for its rather small size and slow speed. I tried to make it stop, but its armor was immaculate!\"\n\n\"How did you get it to be your friend?\"\n\n\"Well, I eventually ruined its track.\"\n\n\"Doesn't it have weapons, though?\"\n\n\"It kind' a ran out of the bag, with a missing guns and parts. So, after catching my breath, I eventually scrounged the sack for anything else- and behold! All sorts of different barrels, guns, ammunition, and parts! That seems like it was made for it!\"\n\n\"I'm assuming you put it on the tank, and it just... trusted you?\"\n\n\"...Yeah, pretty much. I didn't have much to live for, anyway- so why not try and make at least some friend?\"\n\n\"I see. Well, what's that bomb that's been collecting dust, on your desk?\"\n\n\"Oh, something I never let silly 'ol billy touch. It looks like a rather violent device. Perhaps a nuclear device? Yeah, I won't let him touch that! Probably could kill him, too!\"\n\n\"Huh. It could probably be put to good use though, if your life is ever at stake.\"\n\n\"I don't know, man. I don't know if I want to lose him. He's kind of a sweetheart, you know? And a nice little body shield.\" ",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "Freed from the bag, and now freed from the world.\nNow Billy wants to escape the rescue ship.",
    "CHEESEWITHHOLES_BASICTANK_BODY_OUTRO_FAILURE": "",
